// Synthetic: a response without Content-Disposition, logged in the direction of the server, whose file size (618) differs from the response length (402). The response body keeps Suricata's length, and the size stays under `unmapped.fileinfo`.
from_file env("TENZIR_INPUT") {
  read_suricata
}
suricata::ocsf::normalize
this = ocsf_cast(ocsf_derive(this))
drop_null_fields
